  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust (LSETF)- Dokadots Pattern Making and Garment Construction T</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dokadots Clothing LTD is a private training center that offers various courses to trainees interested in studying fashion. Our training services focus on imparting trainees with the required skills to ensure they become top competitors in the job market. Under the proposed program, Dokadots will train 70 students and will place them in paid internships upon completion of the program.</narrative>
  </description>
